<title>USA: Ralcorp sees assets sale closings.</title>
<headline>Ralcorp sees assets sale closings.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS, Mo. 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ralcorp Holdings Inc said Thursday it expects the previously announced sale of its ski resort operations to close in late calendar 1996.</p>
<p>The previously announced sale of its branded cereal and snack business is expected to close in early calendar 1997.</p>
<p>Both are subject to government review.  </p>
<p>In August, Ralcorp said it agreed to sell its brand name cereal and snack line to General Mills Inc for about $570 million, including assumption of debt.</p>
<p>In July, Ralcorp said it would sell its ski resort properties for $310 million.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
